{"version":1,"key":"card:755","content":{"id":755,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"beb59f09-0570-438a-b0be-ce8a01e36c8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供了一个脱离屏幕渲染的画布，它不依赖 DOM 环境，可以在 Worker 中执行。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"07fd1dd5-57e7-4529-9ebc-2f5567605db9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般的 Canvas 在主线程中创建和渲染，如果存在大量粒子、复杂图表等耗时渲染逻辑，就会阻塞主线程，导致页面卡顿。而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 允许我们将渲染过程放到 Worker 线程中执行，主线程只需要获取预先渲染好的帧直接绘制，整个渲染过程完全不阻塞主线程，从而保持丝滑的交互体验。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b29145b6-7670-4051-abad-960724ed01c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此外，由于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不依赖 DOM，在需要 Canvas 能力但没有 DOM 环境的场景（如 Service Worker）中也能派上用场。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9fff5d4e-0b83-4dec-ba99-d359681fda81","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两种方式可以得到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一种是直接 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new OffscreenCanvas()"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"347096d0-07f8-4216-9099-8d4762bd2b1a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d8d62191-4b07-43ba-89fc-25966d4baa80","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"new OffscreenCanvas(width, height)","collabId":"2c1ade34-7bdc-47df-a8b4-dbeb76cd6fed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"097ab92d-5904-4eab-be11-be2f25685e91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一种是在主线程中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"transferControlToOffscreen"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将已有的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Canvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"82999afa-698b-4b56-be08-762e6f3e03c0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fcc9ced3-f442-41c4-99b2-944f13a366ee","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const canvas = document.getElementById('myCanvas');\nconst offscreen = canvas.transferControlToOffscreen();","collabId":"2e7d96ab-51c3-4a7e-946e-8b32e1663c5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"11996358-0aef-4f4a-abf3-7570e10198cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果是在主线程创建的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，需要移交给 Worker 处理时，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"postMessage"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传递。将其放在第二个参数的 transfer 列表中，即作为 Transferable Object 进行零拷贝转移"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"3f11529f-df1e-4cc4-a2ac-8860018c0db4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a1f7cb23-c070-4513-a881-9a16375d424e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const canvas = document.getElementById('myCanvas');\nconst offscreen = canvas.transferControlToOffscreen();\n\nconst worker = new Worker('render-worker.js');\n// 将 OffscreenCanvas 转移给 Worker（零拷贝）\nworker.postMessage({ canvas: offscreen }, [offscreen]);","collabId":"be5034e9-382d-4f9b-b880-cdf1f0584bab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e7c0c1dc-4b76-492c-9a27-179a946de9a5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"88253a6e-4359-43ca-8814-488c5abcc984","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// render-worker.js\nself.onmessage = function (e) {\n  const canvas = e.data.canvas;\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n  function draw() {\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n    \n    // 复杂渲染操作...\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'steelblue';\n    ctx.fillRect(\n      Math.random() * canvas.width,\n      Math.random() * canvas.height,\n      50, 50\n    );\n\n    requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n  }\n  \n  draw();\n};","collabId":"95c002a1-978f-4cb3-8bb7-8c8fe54fb556","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"39f28c9f-c983-4697-864d-92b57e456893","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，转移所有权之后，主线程中原来的 canvas 对象就不可再使用了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aedcf949-537a-451d-b88d-0800fddf0cff","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不渲染在页面上，那如何获取它的内容呢？它提供了两个独有的方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"94db7616-a1cc-453f-ba17-f84c280fce83","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6647469b-ce27-43bc-963c-cbd29fd6b16b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83005bdd-10c5-4f2a-9ef8-aab0eca040f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"transferToImageBitmap"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：以零拷贝方式将当前画布内容提取为一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ImageBitmap"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，同时清空画布。拿到该对象后可以直接绘制到可见画布上；如果在 Worker 中，也可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"postMessage"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传递回主线程消费"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"291982d3-ef58-4956-813b-a23db13aaadd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"30812f03-5b04-4603-9694-c4f1bf377498","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const offscreen = new OffscreenCanvas(200, 200);\nconst ctx = offscreen.getContext('2d');\nctx.fillStyle = 'tomato';\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 200, 200);\n\nconst bitmap = offscreen.transferToImageBitmap();\n// bitmap 拿到了画布内容\n// offscreen 画布此时已被清空（变为透明）\n\n// 可以高效地画到可见 canvas 上\nvisibleCtx.drawImage(bitmap, 0, 0);\nbitmap.close(); // 用完释放 GPU/内存资源","collabId":"960f7692-eb11-44a3-86c0-f90bbe7a28fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7e0f3a28-fbd3-4ee4-b790-57a0562e34ac","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"77038a08-fe09-4735-9ce8-637cbc73c0db","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"convertToBlob(options?)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以将画布内容异步导出为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可用于后续的图片导出或者上传等，它的返回值是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9315d6e-9081-4467-9cea-7c7745f64b0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数包含两个设置项"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"307465ec-3ddd-4ce7-a40e-7d539a1c84cc","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"29c78d73-2188-43bf-9929-89e6c16a2c79","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41cab0e9-d42d-41c3-8e07-dd9c18c0f09a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：指定 MIME 类型，默认值为 image/png"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e37ce480-30b2-4713-a5d8-e595533a2e5c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6849692-dccb-483c-b7cc-325863643d2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"quality"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，压缩质量，仅对 jpeg 和 webp 生效，默认值通常为 0.92"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5e3d1719-4bc9-45bd-8d2a-ad05c275482a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"384bff6e-f573-407a-898c-3933d68312f7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const offscreen = new OffscreenCanvas(400, 300);\nconst ctx = offscreen.getContext('2d');\nctx.fillStyle = 'steelblue';\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 400, 300);\nctx.fillStyle = 'white';\nctx.font = '32px sans-serif';\nctx.fillText('Hello', 150, 160);\n\nconst blob = await offscreen.convertToBlob({\n  type: 'image/png',    // 'image/png' | 'image/jpeg' | 'image/webp'\n  quality: 0.92         // 仅对 jpeg/webp 有效，范围 0~1\n});\n\n// 用途1：下载\nconst url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\nconst a = document.createElement('a');\na.href = url;\na.download = 'output.png';\na.click();\n\n// 用途2：上传\nfetch('/upload', { method: 'POST', body: blob });","collabId":"33754fb0-6593-4d11-86b0-69c790622e60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"72fb93be-94bd-4cb1-9dfb-9359a6d57ea4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"熟悉 Canvas API 会发现存在类似的 API"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"afa8e6e5-800e-46e4-991e-05d753510b39","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0d652ede-705c-42bb-ad4c-1ea67672da1e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8838e6c-a5af-4911-85a5-0c143682a3f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"toDataURL(type, quality)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"078e252b-1258-4fd2-8dfa-905315988f9e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bbfea569-fc71-4d0a-9665-ab561df0cf76","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"toBlob(callback, type, quality)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ed0b146a-9203-499d-87b6-50fc25a410da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但二者都定义在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"HTMLCanvasElement.prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 无法使用。对应的需求可以统一用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"convertToBlob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来替代。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9caf7709-5559-4f76-999c-82e7c516919b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Canvas"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 共享大部分非 DOM 相关的 API，如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getContext()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fill()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等，但部分方法存在限制："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1ecc065f-de0c-42cd-82ea-513889e33011","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bb9fb21e-3a2f-4b11-803b-006b947bc59c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"431d904d-3bd3-49f8-a2c5-56ec67974129","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"drawImage()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，数据源不能是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"HTMLVideoElement"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"HTMLImageElement"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，需要先转为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ImageBitmap"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d4f17dc2-55b3-4f70-83be-7ba736f9883f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bac9db35-0488-4a2f-b58d-fd4ddd99261a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不支持 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"captureStream(fps)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MediaStream"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 深度绑定在浏览器的媒体管线"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/OffscreenCanvas"],"createTime":1781065448344,"updateTime":1781136860704,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1781136860704}}